  "files": [
   {
    "path": "docs/programs/unified-decision-inference-2026-10-21/01-contracts.md",
    "blobAtPin": "a89810065d9120d1abdd3e80a02a20ae20580285",
    "blobAtProbe": "a89810065d9120d1abdd3e80a02a20ae20580285",
    "lines": [
     {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Named ordered immutable observations (JSON/media descriptors), named decision questions, recursively typed output contracts, and explicit execution policy. Output family: Boolean, choice, ranking, pointer, extractive/generated spans and recursively structured compositions. Abstain != False; partial/incomplete/refused/invalid/unsupported/stale are not silently coerced to a choice."
     },
     {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "The pure compiler validates identifiers, bounded state, digests, RFC 6901 pointer candidates, cardinality, candidate IDs, schema, modality, output bounds, score requirements, distinct axes for thinking, generated spans, extractive spans and read-only observations. Route only after hard capability eligibility and context budgeting. Unknown hard capability = reject. No unrequested summarization or weakening."
     },
     {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "Read-only observation is a strictly bounded injected port; no embedded agent orchestrator, no unrestricted tools. ReactiveAgentsSDK or host authorizes effects and observation sources. An emitted reference is snapshot-bound and must be revalidated before use. Inference never executes UI actions."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "path": "docs/programs/unified-decision-inference-2026-10-21/02-implementation.md",
    "blobAtPin": "05c09af36db8f9151cf45de182f7d0f3ca3a0387",
    "blobAtProbe": "05c09af36db8f9151cf45de182f7d0f3ca3a0387",
    "lines": [
     {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "RI-DEC-03: deterministic candidate expansion (RFC 6901, wildcard input only), cardinality and size budgets, digests, redacted source provenance."
     },
     {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "RI-DEC-07: strict result validator, abstention, atomic/partial batch semantics, retry/cancellation, transient errors and snapshot freshness."
     },
     {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "Current implementation: RI-DEC-02/04/05 **initial restricted seed only**, with choice questions and pure preflight, NOT provider execution or advanced output support."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "path": "docs/programs/unified-decision-inference-2026-10-21/03-conformance.md",
    "blobAtPin": "2ed40f651d8a3c988a89e8ed53173259f54d9bc4",
    "blobAtProbe": "2ed40f651d8a3c988a89e8ed53173259f54d9bc4",
    "lines": [
     {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "Booleans/abstention, rankings/ties/top_k, exact pointer revision/digest checks, Unicode byte/character extractive span offsets, recursively nested structured values, malformed provider tool output, lack of stream-tool semantics, native/generative parity for eligible finalizers, timeout and cancellation, failed atomic joint retry, partial independent result policy, full/partial/missing score provenance, multimodal and context budgets, prompt/template injection scope for declared read-only observations."
     }
